  "instructions": [
    "Heat the sesame oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chopped tomatoes and cook for 3 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the soy sauce, rice vinegar, and lime juice.",
    "Pour the sauce over the tomatoes and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in the chopped green onions, toasted sesame seeds, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Remove the skillet from the heat and let it cool to room temperature.",
    "Serve the namul chilled or at room temperature."
  ],
